      "text": "Let \\( f(x) = 3 \\sqrt{x} + 3 \\). Let R be the region bounded by the graph of f, the line \\( y = 3 \\), and the vertical line \\( x = 1 \\). Find the exact volume of the solid generated when R is revolved about the line \\( y = 3 \\).",
